Companies House iXBRL samples
=============================

The instance documents in this directory (and `sample.tar.zst` when
packed with `ch-xbrl-mksample`) are real company accounts filings
taken from the UK Companies House public register (Accounts Data Product).

They are not licensed under the MIT licence that covers the ch-xbrl
source code.

Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government
Licence v3.0.

    https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

Source:

    https://download.companieshouse.gov.uk/en_accountsdata.html

Some files are single filing-history document downloads rather than
members of an Accounts Data Product zip. The filing URL is recorded
in docs/edge-cases.md. They are the same public register filings.

Four CCH headcount fixtures (`Prod223_4320_13368913_20251231.html`,
`Prod223_4320_00719324_20260405.html`, `Prod223_4320_07640901_20260530.html`,
`Prod223_4320_01154766_20251231.html`) are trimmed from
Accounts_Bulk_Data-2026-10-02.zip. Each keeps the producer facts, the
employee and percentage facts, and the contexts and units those facts use.

`Prod224_2266_02955230_20230930.html` is trimmed from
Accounts_Monthly_Data-June2024.zip. It keeps the producer facts, the
employee facts, and the contexts and unit those facts use.

The Open Government Licence does not cover personal data. Do not treat
these filings as a source of personal data except as permitted by
data-protection law.
